{
  "name": "GD·04 Answer · Meta comments and DMs",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GD·04 Answer (Boss 5 · D5, from 5.5)\nOne Meta webhook for Page feed comments, Instagram comments and DMs. GET answers Meta's verification once; every POST is checked with X-Hub-Signature-256 (HMAC-SHA256 of the raw body with the app secret).\nComments: label → ALLOWED ACTIONS COMPUTED IN CODE from timestamps and platform rules → AI chooses only among them → code rejects anything else → reply / private reply / hide / hand over.\nDMs go to GD·05 Unify (one customer, one answer on the latest channel); a DM whose customer window (24 h) has closed is never answered automatically.\nLeads are saved with source and consent; business leads go to GD·08.\n\nTable: inbox(item_id pk, platform, kind, thread_id, author_id, text, received_at, status, private_sent, responded_at, lead_id).\n**Credentials:** Postgres, Facebook Graph API (Page token), OpenAI, Telegram.\n**Env:** META_APP_SECRET, META_VERIFY_TOKEN, NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto, N8N_BLOCK_ENV_ACCESS_IN_NODE=false.\n**Replace:** YOUR_PAGE_ID, YOUR_GD05_WORKFLOW_ID, YOUR_GD08_WORKFLOW_ID, YOUR_MODEL, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "0fa6f16f-9f6f-443b-84db-8079cb0db2ea",
